PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Reasoning Modes
    - Left: Smooth geometry bubble
    - Right: Discrete automaton bubble
  L2: Context Vector
    - Vector X inside left bubble
  L3: Transport Arrow
    - Large curved arrow from left bubble to right bubble
    - 8px stroke, bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
    - Labeled "𝒯"
  L4: Output Vector
    - Same vector X inside right bubble
    - Orientation preserved
  L5: Labels
    - "Context Transport Operator"
    - "𝒯(X)"
  L6: Annotation Overlay
    - Text: "Parallel transport across reasoning modes"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
